&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Robinhood’s &lt;strong&gt;Money Experience team&lt;/strong&gt; builds the customer-facing money movement experience in the app. The team owns core transfer flows and works across experiences like deposits, withdrawals, recurring deposits, transfer history, post-transfer pages, incoming wires, and guided transfer flows, including launches such as recurring extra cash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Android Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;on the Money Experience team, you would build and improve Android experiences that help customers move money into, out of, and between Robinhood accounts. You would contribute to features like account selection, transfer validation, deposit and withdrawal flows, post-transfer experiences, and the migration to newer guided transfer flows, working as part of a mobile team that includes multiple Android and iOS engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
