&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting the rollout of retail-based customer products and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills, with the ability to communicate information effectively to non-legal audiences and drive cross-functional alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An execution-oriented mindset with the agility, drive, and creativity to deliver results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
