&lt;p&gt;The Business Development Desk is a proactive outbound sales team responsible for general asset gathering and migrating customers into our Concierge program through consolidation of assets. This team serves as brand ambassadors, education and creating awareness of all the available products and solutions available that would help the customer reach their financial goals. The team works closely with all of our customer facing teams to ensure a truly white glove/Concierge experience through the onboarding process. In this role, you will lead a team responsible for growing assets and expanding customer relationships here at Robinhood..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Manager of Business Development, you will lead, coach, and develop a team of Onboarding Specialists who support customers throughout their onboarding journey while also exploring any additional opportunities to consolidate/win more share of wallet. You will oversee and enhance sales pipelines, review opportunities worked for Compliance and Oversight and coaching to overall sales process and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for driving team strategy, establishing operating efficiency, and driving asset growth through pipeline management and ongoing coaching and development of sales agents. In addition to developing your team, you will partner closely with product, compliance, legal, and external service providers to evolve the Business Development Desk offering, expand pipelines of opportunities and ensure all customer interactions meet all regulatory standards including RegBI and telemarketing compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly cross-functional leadership role where you will work closely with our customer facing teams and business partners to drive/increase referrals to the desk and identify operational and account signals to automate additional opportunities to win new business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Denver, CO or Westlake, TX office(s), with in-person attendance expected 5 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams. Local travel may be required to meet with customers and participate in in-person events.&lt;/p&gt;
