&lt;li&gt;Identify process gaps, pain points, and inefficiencies across the crypto product lifecycle—and implement improvements through automation, enhanced tooling, or revised procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze operational metrics to ensure processes are performing as expected, and lead cross-functional efforts to address any issues or optimize performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
