&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You manage endpoint devices, identity systems, Okta, Google Cloud infrastructure, and Google Workspace to maintain secure and reliable operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You design and build tools based on internal requirements to improve system functionality and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You develop automation for device, account, and identity lifecycle management processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You support engineering teams by troubleshooting system issues and resolving escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You review write and code, write clear documentation, and follow established engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience as a Systems, Site Reliability, Infrastructure, or related engineer, typically with 5+ years in similar environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience managing macOS or Windows devices using modern endpoint management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are familiar with AI-assisted development tools such as Claude Code or Gemini&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience coding or scripting in languages such as Python, Swift, Go, Bash, or PowerShell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You approach problems methodically, work well independently or with others, and focus on improving employee-facing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
