&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Drive the product roadmap for Robinhood Wallet, evolving the existing experience while defining what’s next—including new products and localized experiences for priority markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Partner with research, data science, engineering, and design to understand new customers, identify their most pressing needs, and translate insights into product strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Build strong, collaborative relationships across design, engineering, operations, and other cross-functional partners to align teams and drive execution at both the team and organizational levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Lead the launch of intuitive, high-impact products in partnership with communications, content, and marketing teams, ensuring experiences are easy to understand and use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
