&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build backend services and data pipelines that securely store, process, and route customer data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop systems for token issuance, user authentication, and anonymization to support privacy requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the vision for authentication across next-generation AI platforms, intelligent agents, and MCP ecosystems, shaping how secure identity works in an AI-first world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data retention and deletion workflows aligned with regulatory standards such as CCPA and GDPR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with access management engineers to enforce least-privilege access controls across systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to monitoring and auditing systems that track how data is accessed and used&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
