&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll design, develop, and operate distributed systems that support core data pipelines and real-time event processing. You’ll collaborate with engineers across product, data, and ML teams to scale our platform, improve reliability, and enhance the developer experience across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s some of the exciting challenges the team has been solving:&lt;/p&gt;
