&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;About the Team + Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Robinhood is assembling an elite team applying advanced technology to the country&#39;s biggest financial challenges. National Impact builds industry-changing products in partnership with the U.S. Government that expands financial access for millions of Americans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The team launched its debut product, Trump Accounts, as the #1 app in the app store and one of the fastest-growing financial products launched to date. The year ahead is about growing and improving this product while expanding into new verticals where Robinhood can partner with government stakeholders to reach millions more Americans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As the lead Product Manager for National Impact, you will own 0-1 products end to end, from initial concept through national rollout, shaping how millions of Americans access, understand, and participate in the financial system. You will set both the strategy and the quality bar for one of Robinhood&#39;s most visible product lines, where craft translates directly into customer trust. You&#39;ll work alongside senior leadership, engineers, designers, researchers, data scientists, and marketers to decide where we play, turn ambiguous regulatory and partnership requirements into straightforward customer experiences, and hold the line on quality through launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a rare opportunity to drive outsized impact at the intersection of fintech, consumer product, and public-private partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The preferred location for this role is New York, NY, in office a minimum of 3 days per week, with comfort traveling to Washington, DC on a semi-regular basis to work directly with our government partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end product for 0-1 launches, from initial concept through national rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Set and execute the product vision and strategy for National Impact, including growing Trump Accounts and identifying the next verticals where a government partnership unlocks financial access at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead a team of engineers, designers, researchers, data scientists, marketers, and cross-functional partners to better understand customers, government stakeholders, and the most pressing barriers to financial access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Set the quality bar — the copy, flows, edge cases, and launch readiness that make complex financial and government workflows feel simple and trustworthy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Translate ambiguous regulatory, operational, and partnership requirements into clear, dependable customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner closely with legal, compliance, policy, operations, finance, communications, and external partners so products get built the right way the first time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Keep teams aligned and moving quickly across product, regulatory, operational, and partnership workstreams, and deliver on time against public commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Communicate strategy, tradeoffs, and the reasoning behind them to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of ambition, learning, and iteration through experimentation, customer research, and thinking big&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience building and shipping high-quality consumer fintech product experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working with 3rd-party partners on large-scale projects to deliver a shared product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A track record of shipping 0-1 products at scale, beyond prototypes and pilots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong product judgment and the ability to turn ambiguous opportunities into clear strategy, roadmap, and execution plans&lt;/li&gt;
