&lt;li&gt;Remain deeply hands-on by writing production code, leading complex implementations, and setting the standard for engineering quality across the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve developer practices and lead the adoption of the latest AI tooling to maximize engineering output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical excellence across reliability, correctness, observability, and security&lt;/li&gt;
