&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mindset with a track record of delivering high-impact, end-to-end product outcomes and raising team-wide technical standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience mentoring and developing engineers, fostering technical excellence and long-term career growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
